## ==========================================
## .gitignore Oficial para Ate (.NET 10 + Angular)
## ==========================================

# ------------------------------------------
# 1. Archivos de Compilación & Salida .NET
# ------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.suo
*.cache
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb

# ------------------------------------------
# 2. Entornos de Desarrollo e IDEs (.vs, VS Code, Rider)
# ------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
*.swp
*.bak
*~
*.DotSettings.user

# ------------------------------------------
# 3. Secretos & Archivos de Entorno (.env)
# ------------------------------------------
*.env
*.env.local
*.env.development
*.env.production
appsettings*.Secret.json
appsettings.Local.json

# ------------------------------------------
# 4. Frontend & Node.js / Angular (Para cuando agreguemos Angular)
# ------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.angular/
.npm
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ------------------------------------------
# 5. Sistema Operativo & Temporales
# ------------------------------------------
[Tt]humbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.log
